  "goodToKnow": "Die Uraufführung is the world premiere, the very first performance of a work: Beethovens Neunte had its Uraufführung in Vienna in 1824, Wagner's Ring cycle at the first Bayreuth Festival in 1876. Die Premiere is the opening night of any new production, and die Erstaufführung the first performance in a particular country or city. Ur- means original: der Urwald, die Urzeit. Plural: die Uraufführungen."
